  "what_this_is": "The world's SVT account-day share moved to the published GB domestic default-tariff share, hazards untouched, measured against the same rung-1 band the verdict uses. `reach x exposure` is rescaled because that product IS the published statistic's quantity; the renewal route moves with it because the two are complements.",
